  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Agenda (Serbia)-UNDP-SRB-00130769</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims at building strong partnerships between the public sector, private companies and civil society, to accelerate green transformation. The European Green Deal and the Green Agenda for the Western Balkans offer a blueprint for joint action to tackle the challenges of the green transition. Broad societal participation is necessary to trigger transformative change. In line with this ambition, this project is designed to build broad engagement and participation in the Green Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
